Skia: "[graphite] Neutralize pending SkSL RP branches on failure and
propagate SkTransformShader errors" (Skia bug 574214629; no CVE listed yet):
when SkSL::RP::Program::appendStages() gave up part way, branch contexts
already appended kept offsets that could make the partially populated
raster pipeline dispatch out of bounds if executed; SkTransformShader also
ignored its child's failure. Skia main commit
9bed3ec0d4080a49618f1df279aefe0783ab3761, merged on 2026-10-30 to
chrome/m156 (1c9382b333e2dd0f26d4847143580470cd6950c4) and chrome/m157
(6ec96df24d6ebb89e7483aaef4ac55743480833a). This is the m157 merge, without its
tests, at third_party/skia. Drop it once a 157 tag's Skia has it.

